            <p><a class="colorboxModal cboxElement" href="https://www.sfc.hk/-/media/EN/files/LIC/handbook/footnote_fee_per_ra.png?rev=65d6f6eb5bb043fea3340b7ac10cdffe&amp;hash=40A2BD76FCBDE3ED8180049EF6D34FAF">$1,790 per RA</a></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
            <p>Type 3</p>
            </td>
