            <p><a class="colorboxModal cboxElement" href="https://www.sfc.hk/-/media/EN/files/LIC/handbook/footnote_plr_fee.png?rev=8024fb7a9f244cce87ba32675b52916a&amp;hash=D3E5772ECF924FA759AB21A1DAF6D1C3">$800 per application</a></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
