            <p>The application fee payable for Type 7 regulated activity is waived if the applicant&rsquo;s proposed carrying on of Type 7 regulated activity is incidental to the carrying on, or proposed carrying on, of Type 1 or Type 2 regulated activity by that applicant.</p>
